<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Te Amo Cuchito</title>
  <style>
    /* Estilo general */
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5af19, #f12711);
      font-family: "Arial", sans-serif;
      color: #fff;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 4rem;
      text-align: center;
      animation: fade-in 2s ease-in-out;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .heart {
      font-size: 100px;
      color: red;
      text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: scale(1);
      }
      50% {
        transform: scale(1.2);
      }
    }

    @keyframes fade-in {
      0% {
        opacity: 0;
      }
      100% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div>
    <h1>Te amo, cuchito ❤️</h1>
    <p>Eres el amor de mi vida y mi faro en la oscuridad.</p>
    <div class="heart">❤️</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>